          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mkaliŵalila kwaŵilanga Alefi ŵamkutama nawo m'misi mwenu ku cele cindimbaci. Pakuŵa jemanjaji nginakola cilambo cakulima mbeju syawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'malo mwakutendela cindimba, ya likumi ya mbeju simgowele, kumbesi kwa caka catatu cilicose, myice nayo yosopeyo ku msinda kuti ayisunje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakulya yeleyi yili yawo Alefi, pakuŵa ŵangali malo gawo gakulima, soni yakulya yeleyi yakwakamucisya nayo acalendo, ŵanace ŵamasije, ni acakongwe ŵamasije",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵakutama m'misinda jenu. Ŵandu ŵeleŵa ayiceje mu msinda kujigala yindu yikwasoŵa. Naga ŵandu ŵeleŵa akukola yakulya yakwanila, AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu takampe upile pa masengo galigose gatimkatende ni yalayenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
